<title>YEMEN: Yemen signs oil deal with Hungary's MOL.</title>
<headline>Yemen signs oil deal with Hungary's MOL.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen has signed an oil production and sharing agreement with Hungary's oil and gas company MOL Rt for work in the Arab state, state television said.</p>
<p>The company's concession is in sector 49 of Shabwa governorate, east of the capital Sanaa.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, the company will carry out seismic surveys and drill exploratory wells in the area in two phases. The work will cost at least $8 million, the television said.</p>
</text>
